From 1d23a597f4857a4d333b9db3e41c7487b1dadf08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chiro <chiro2001@163.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 17:19:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 239/257] feat(execution): U2b int8/W8A8 AOCL vendor provider
 (qmatmul_s8s8_s32)

Bind the pinned AOCL/LPGEMM int8 path into the U1/U2a execution plane:

* op_registry: register the W8A8 qmatmul_s8s8_s32 contract (int8 x int8 ->
  int32, rank 2-4, K <= 133144, codes [-127,127], Core IR alias mirror);
  the matmul contract document/digest is unchanged
* provider_aocl_int8: probe + manifest for vendor:aocl-lpgemm-int8 on the
  same pinned Q8 artifact (BLIS 5.3.2 zen4, sha256 c7d74a31...); the kernel
  consumes the c1 packed [K,out] row-major weight directly (0 reorder,
  0 per-forward transfer) via aocl_gemm_s8s8s32os32(mem_format_b='n');
  adapter-level fail-closed for -128 and K >= 133145 (LPGEMM accepts/wraps
  silently) and a per-K measured envelope
* numeric class deterministic_bounded: bitwise vs the contract int32
  reference for K <= 1024 across all measured distributions/threads; the
  KC=2048 binary32 block-chain envelope is declared as
  max(Q8 reference, U2b measured) and pinned (q8_reference_bound_by_k /
  measured_bound_by_k / measurement_scope) into provider_artifact_digest;
  the fused aocl_gemm_s8s8s32obf16_sym_quant variant is declared and
  exercised (two-multiply (acc*s_w)*s_a order witness, K%4 and n>=2
  preconditions) but not routed through the 2-operand SPI
* resolver/entry/plan/report/binding_verify: qmatmul shares the two-operand
  resolver body, plan/execute APIs and report; exactness_basis stays the
  0042 family value with the provider-specific detail in a separate field;
  the named rule-echo surface of genuine portable and vendor qmatmul reports
  passes the 0042 cross-block checks
* tests: qmatmul regressions (portable + vendor, bit envelope, reserved
  code, forged plan/report, fused witness, every named-rule echo key)

Evidence: _meta/pypto-x/u2b-vendor-int8/{brief.zh-CN.md,raw,logs,scripts}
plus ERR-0010 / 0006 section 8.2 correction in the control repo.
